<div id="pf45" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="45"><div class="pc pc45 w0 h0"><img class="bi x4 y1140 w4 h57" alt="" src="bg45.png"/><div class="t m0 x4 hb y33 ff9 fs1 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">7<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _13"> </span>深度学习及其优化算法<span class="_ _6e"> </span><span class="ff3">7.4<span class="_ _13"> </span></span>反向传播算法<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Backpropagation)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xf h10 ya09 ff9 fs4 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ff6">7.4<span class="_ _5f"> </span><span class="ff1">反向传播算法<span class="_ _e"> </span></span>(Bac<span class="_ _3"></span>kpropag<span class="_ _5"></span>ation)</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 yae0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">反向传播算法是训练神经网络的基石。<span class="_ _3d"></span>它本质上是链式法则在计算图<span class="_ _3d"></span>（<span class="ff3">Computational<span class="_ _19"> </span>Graph</span>）<span class="_ _2b"></span>上的高效应用，</div><div class="t m0 x4 h6 yae1 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">通过递归地计算梯度来解决复杂的参数更新问题。</div><div class="t m0 xf h16 yae2 ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.4.1<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">计算图与梯度流</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 yf9b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">将复杂的神经网络模型分解为由基本算子（加、乘、激活等）组成的有向无环图。</div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y1141 ff1 fs1 fc2 sc0 ls0 ws0">定理<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">7.4.1<span class="_ _0"> </span>(</span>梯度传播链式法则<span class="ff6">)</span></div><div class="t m0 x10 h11 y1142 ffa fs1 fca sc0 ls0 ws0">♡</div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y1143 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">对于计<span class="_ _1"></span>算图中<span class="_ _1"></span>的任意<span class="_ _1"></span>节点</div><div class="t m0 xfe h12 y1144 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑧</div><div class="t m0 x2b h1a y1143 ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=</div><div class="t m0 x101 h12 y1144 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑓</div><div class="t m0 x61 h11 y1143 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">(</div><div class="t m0 x3e h12 y1144 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑥<span class="_ _1"></span>,<span class="_ _c"> </span>𝑦</div><div class="t m0 xce h11 y1143 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">)</div><div class="t m0 x5c h3 y1144 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，假设<span class="_ _1"></span>已知最<span class="_ _1"></span>终损失</div><div class="t m0 xa4 h12 y1143 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐿</div><div class="t m0 xfb h3 y1144 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">关于</div><div class="t m0 xcd h12 y1143 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑧</div><div class="t m0 x94 h3 y1144 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">的梯度</div><div class="t m0 x102 h14 y1145 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x136 h14 y1146 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑧</div><div class="t m0 xb5 h3 y1143 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">（称为上<span class="_ _1"></span>游梯度</div><div class="t m0 xc4 h7 y1144 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">, Upstream</div><div class="t m0 x53 h3 y1147 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Gradient<span class="ff2">）<span class="_ _29"></span>。根据链式法则，损失关于输入<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>的梯度</span></div><div class="t m0 xb1 h14 y1148 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x75 h14 y1149 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x38 h3 y1147 ff2 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">可以分解为：</div><div class="t m0 x15 h12 y114a ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _15"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x13 h12 y114b ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x54 h1a y114c ffd fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">=</div><div class="t m0 x75 h12 y114a ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _15"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x75 h12 y114b ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _15"></span>𝑧</div><div class="t m0 x5e h11 y114c ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">·</div><div class="t m0 xac h12 y114a ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _15"></span>𝑧</div><div class="t m0 xac h12 y114b ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y114d ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">梯度的组成：</div><div class="t m0 x82 h6 y114e ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">下游梯度<span class="_ _a"> </span><span class="ffd">=<span class="_ _a"> </span></span>上游梯度<span class="_ _f"> </span><span class="ffa">×<span class="_ _25"> </span></span>局部梯度</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y114f ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">上游梯度<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(U<span class="_ _3"></span>pstream<span class="_ _c"> </span>Gradient)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x2f h14 y1150 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x2f h14 y1151 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑧</div><div class="t m0 xa6 h6 y114f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，包含了从当前节点到最终<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">Loss<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>的所有后续路径的梯度信息。</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y1152 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">局部梯<span class="_ _1"></span>度<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff6">(Local<span class="_ _0"> </span>Gradient)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x67 h14 y1153 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑧</div><div class="t m0 x67 h14 yaf9 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x41 h6 y1152 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，仅取<span class="_ _1"></span>决于当前<span class="_ _1"></span>节点的运<span class="_ _1"></span>算性质<span class="_ _1"></span>和前向传<span class="_ _1"></span>播时的输<span class="_ _1"></span>入值，与<span class="_ _1"></span>网络的</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y1154 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">其他部分无关。</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y1155 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">下游梯度<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Do<span class="_ _5"></span>wnstream<span class="_ _0"> </span>Gradient)<span class="ff4">：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x70 h14 y1156 ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x70 h14 yafd ffc fs5 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜕<span class="_ _1"></span>𝑥</div><div class="t m0 x119 h6 y1155 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，计算结果将作为新的上游梯度传递给前驱节点。</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y1157 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">常见节点的梯度行为：</div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y1158 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">加法节点<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(+)<span class="ff4">：梯度分发器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Distributor)</span>。将上游梯度原样复制给所有输入分支（局部梯度为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">1</span>）<span class="_ _29"></span>。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y1159 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">乘法节点<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff6">(*)<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _28"></span>梯度交换器<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff3">(Switcher)</span>。<span class="_ _28"></span>输入<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑥<span class="_ _2"> </span></span>的梯度是上游梯度乘以另一个输入<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑦<span class="_ _5"></span><span class="ff4">（局部梯度为<span class="_ _2"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑦<span class="_ _1"></span></span>）<span class="_ _29"></span>。</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y115a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">最大值节点<span class="_ _c"> </span><span class="ff6">(max)<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _2b"></span>梯度路由器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(R<span class="_ _3"></span>outer)<span class="ff4">。<span class="_ _4"></span>将上游梯度完整路由给在前向传播中值最大的输入，<span class="_ _2b"></span>其余</span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 xfd h6 y115b ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">输入梯度为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">0</span>。</div><div class="t m0 xf h16 y115c ff6 fs6 fc6 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.4.2<span class="_ _21"> </span><span class="ff1">反向传播实例详解</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y115d ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为了深入理解反向传播的机制，我们分析一个具体的计算图实例。</div><div class="t m0 x52 h6 y115e ff1 fs1 fc2 sc0 ls0 ws0">例题<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">7.1.<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>复杂函数的反向传播</div><div class="t m0 x53 h6 y115f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">考虑函数<